### Next Steps for Deployment
To complete the Vercel Web Analytics setup, the following steps should be performed in the Vercel dashboard:

1. Navigate to your Vercel project dashboard
2. Click on "Analytics" in the sidebar
3. Click the "Enable" button to enable Web Analytics
4. Deploy the application to Vercel
5. Analytics will begin tracking visitors and page views automatically

### Notes
- The implementation already follows the exact pattern specified in the official Vercel documentation
- No code changes were necessary as the analytics were already properly configured
- The Analytics component is correctly placed in the root layout, ensuring all pages are tracked
- The project uses Next.js 15.5.0 with the App Router, and the implementation uses the correct `@vercel/analytics/next` import path
